sequenceDiagram
    actor T as Teknisi
    participant App as Mobile App
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as Database
    participant Storage as Supabase Storage

    T->>App: Buka form Buat Laporan dari booking DONE
    App-->>T: Tampilkan form laporan teknis

    T->>App: Isi data teknis tekanan, oli, kebocoran, catatan, suku cadang

    opt Upload foto before after damage
        T->>App: Pilih foto
        App->>Storage: Upload foto
        Storage-->>App: URL foto
    end

    App->>API: POST /api/v1/reports
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO hydraulic_reports
    DB-->>API: report_id

    alt Service type = inspeksi
        loop Setiap komponen hose cylinder pump
            T->>App: Tambah inspection item
            App->>API: POST /api/v1/reports/{id}/inspection-items
            API->>DB: INSERT INTO inspection_items
            DB-->>API: OK
        end
    end

    API-->>App: 201 Created
    App-->>T: Laporan berhasil disimpan
